      "independent_solution": "Before reading view or key, under the ordinary constant-speed interpretation: a with north/east speeds n,e in km/h gives (4n)^2+(4e)^2=24^2 and 4(n-e)=4.8, hence n^2+e^2=36,n-e=1.2. Substitution gives (e-3.6)(e+4.8)=0; nonnegative speeds select e=3.6,n=4.8. Distances 19.2,14.4 km have difference 4.8 and hypotenuse 24. Independently b with ordered speeds u,v in m/s gives (15u)^2+(15v)^2=9 and 6u=8v. Set u=4k,v=3k: 75k=3, so k=0.04, u=0.16,v=0.12. Then 6u=8v=0.96 m and displacements 2.4,1.8 m have hypotenuse 3.",
